
041290
CONFERENCES,FIGGY,STANDARDS,HYPERTEXT,BUGS
A very informal Figgy held 4/12/90. Discussing bugs in general, an attendant's
inability to make a program in TCOM work with color, real time programming,
latest on vocabulaary standards, navigating hypertext, standards for division
and other arithmetic operations.

Figgy Bar April 12 1990

  1 Little rock,AR      2   L [Gary] GARY-S
